Subject: [PATCH 5/7] innodb: adapt filesystem assumptions for WASIX

Enable the Clang atomic fence skipped by cross-compilation probes and account
for mounted-volume behavior observed under Wasmer: no process advisory locks,
no directory fsync, zero st_blksize metadata, and no useful madvise dump flags.
Regular file fsync/fdatasync and InnoDB's internal locking remain enabled.

